Build and install notes
=======================

Build the command line encoder with the maintained top-level Makefile:

    make

Run the encoder smoke test:

    make test

Remove generated build outputs:

    make clean

The build uses the checked-in config.h and does not require autotools,
configure, automake, or libtool.

Useful overrides:

    make CC=clang
    make CFLAGS="-O2 -Wall"
    make LDFLAGS="..."

The default target builds:

    frontend/lame
    libmp3lame/libmp3lame.a
    mpglib/libmpgdecoder.a
